Z||000006||Haze_Performance||04-20-2001||01:47 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Cheever2:<BR><B>Superb.<P>Those glove boxes like you have on the passenger side of the dash: are they any good?  How are they mounted?</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>They go on with 4 screws.  Its very easy to install. It goes on in 15 mins. & its very sturdy. I LOVE IT!!!! I dont know how I got along without it before. I just ordered one for the '85.. <P><P>------------------<BR><A HREF="http://www.ws6fiero.com" TARGET=_blank><BR>       <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/haze8588logo.gif">  </A>       <BR><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/WS6_Fiero/photo.html" TARGET=_blank><BR>Pennock's Fiero Forum Members Photo Page</A>||||reg||14
