Z||000008||AkursedX||04-20-2001||01:56 AM||||Interior looks great!!  Every manual Fiero needs a short shifter!<P>I do rememeber that car now.  And I think it looks great except for the sail window covers!!!  I just think it would look so much better without them, but that' my opinion.  <P>So you gotta tell us!! What do you got powering that thing??  Stock?  v8?  3.4?<BR>For some odd reason, I just don't see it being stock  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">||||reg||14
