Z||000011||Black88GT||04-20-2001||07:06 AM||||Not sure if I like the nose, I was debating on getting one for a future project.  Do you have any side pics of the car?  Also, what kind of motor does it have?<P>------------------<BR>Jeff<BR>'88 GT t-top 3.4<BR>Baltimore, MD - MAFOA<BR>         <IMG SRC="http://88database.homestead.com/files/AF.gif">    <BR><I>"Once you go black, you never go back..."</I><BR><I>"The Customer Can Have Any Color He Wants So Long As It's Black" </I> -Henry Ford||||reg||5
Z||000012||Haze_Performance||04-20-2001||12:32 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by onfire:<BR><B>You need to back up a few inches. You are making me nervous parking that close to the curb.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>That was just a test park.. I wanted to see how far up I could go.. Now I park 10 feet from it.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> lol<P> <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by AkursedX:<BR><B>Interior looks great!!  Every manual Fiero needs a short shifter!<P>So you gotta tell us!! What do you got powering that thing??  Stock?  v8?  3.4?<BR>For some odd reason, I just don't see it being stock   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Its only a 2.8  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P> <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by bHooper:<BR><B>sweet looking interior!  you say it's getting wet sanded... did they not finish the paint job?!<BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>It was painted last month. The guy put 4 coats of clear on it and didnt have time to finish it. (I bought it  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> )<P> <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Black88GT:<BR><B>Not sure if I like the nose, I was debating on getting one for a future project.  Do you have any side pics of the car?  Also, what kind of motor does it have?<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I dont have any side shots.. To tell you the truth, I didnt like the front end much when I first saw it. But now that Ive been driving it around... I think its cool. In the past 3 days Ive had a New C5, 96 Vette, 2000 WS6 T/A, 2 95ish Z28's, Silver Viper R/T 10, 93 Mustang & New Mustang all want to race me. I dont think anyone (except the Viper, Who was just playing with me on the expressway) knows what the car is. I love messin with the Import guys..<P>Thanks to Oreif Im entertaining the thought of a 3.4 swap... <P><P>------------------<BR><A HREF="http://www.ws6fiero.com" TARGET=_blank><BR>       <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/haze8588logo.gif">  </A>       <BR><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/WS6_Fiero/photo.html" TARGET=_blank><BR>Pennock's Fiero Forum Members Photo Page</A>||||reg||14
Z||000013||Haze-ette||04-20-2001||12:50 PM||||Well, even though I am Haze's wife - I thought I would reply, that I LOVE the car and all the attention I get when I am driving it, which by the way, is not that often....YET !!! <P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Hazettelogo.gif"> ||||reg||10
