Z||000032||Fiero5||04-25-2001||02:50 PM||||WOW! That is one awesome lookin' Formula! Nice Fiero Haze.<P>I see you also have the "Formula" steering wheel. I will show my wife Marian, so she won't feel as bad about not liking the stock 4 spoker with always bumping into and easily breaking off horn buttons and going with the true Formula grey leather steering wheel herself. She never liked that 4 spoke ears button thing, and she thought that her Formula should have a Formula steering wheel.<P>Seems that the fastback conversion is a popular thing these days...  Heh, heh, heh<P>Right Marian?<P>Steve<P>||||reg||6
